  "pixel_findings": [
    "Dormer cheeks now meet beneath the slate cap with a clean seated front gable. The projecting beige strips and earlier open rake wedge are absent. Glazing retains physical opening depth and carrier roof penetration.",
    "Main headhouse front/rear bearing frieze remains closed. Cornice reveals and lit edges have backing, and roof-to-clock and pavilion joins remain credible.",
    "A broad continuous barrel vault, deep crossed open end lattice, side spandrels, raised ridge, projecting Gothic pavilions and offset grounded clock shaft preserve the source-specific hierarchy.",
    "Open entrance arcade, ticket counters, cafe furniture, platform signs, three track lanes and two enclosed static coaches establish a coherent station programme.",
    "Both stair approaches, upper gallery edges and connecting bridge are visually continuous, with visible guardrails and clear circulation space in the reviewed views.",
    "Whole-building views and three phone boards show complete model bounds, neutral margins and the locked source variant. No new P0/P1 visual regressions were identified."
  ],
